### 注册（无需 Token）
POST http://localhost:1236/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student04",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 登录（无需 Token）
POST http://localhost:1236/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 查看 JWT 信息
GET http://localhost:1236/api/user/token-info
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJzdHVkZW50MDEiLCJ1c2VySWQiOjEsImlhdCI6MTc5MDc1NTY3NCwiZXhwIjoxNzkwODQyMDc0fQ.7HiSGCu0Mdj-pNiTV8RVNRROR4JE3cm6yqZYBJpXHpU

### 创建待办
